# Vendor firmware downloads. Large, and not ours to redistribute -- the same
# policy FIRMWARES/.gitignore already applies to the BIOS image.
#
# This directory also cannot coexist with FIRMWARES/ in a checkout on a
# case-insensitive filesystem, so tracking it broke cloning on macOS and
# Windows outright.
#
# Nothing committed depends on these. They were downloaded while checking the
# Thunderbolt claim in MACHINE.md and were never used. To get them again:
#   BIOS packages   https://download.lenovo.com/pccbbs/mobiles/n24uj<NN>w.exe
#   BIOS readmes    https://download.lenovo.com/pccbbs/mobiles/n24ur<NN>w.html
#   Dock firmware   https://support.lenovo.com  ->  ThinkPad Thunderbolt 3 Dock
firmwares/
